{"obsah":"<p>Michal Budský and Mára Tryner made a proper Moravian trip, going from north to south. The first stop was a children's day in Písek near Jablunkov, where they started their exhibition on the team's folding obstacles.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Meanwhile Martin Šimůnek was running a workshop at a children's day in Hradec Králové, and Vlasta and Matouš set off for the traditional Great-Grandpa's Tractor event in Čáslav. Every year you can see loads of historic machinery, a programme for kids and adults, and occasionally more extreme things like our show. The guys rode two shows – the first to warm up and the second at full throttle for a decent number of spectators, who weren't put off even by the heat radiating from the melting asphalt.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8093.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8093.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237443\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_7930.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_7930.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237444\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_7949.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_7949.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237446\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8057.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8057.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237447\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8062.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8062.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237448\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8070.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8070.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237449\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8077.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8077.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237450\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8079.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8079.webp?alt=media\" a